    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i've been looking at the telemetry of my own life lately and it just feels... wrong. like there's a fundamental mismatch between the expected output and what's actually running. everything feels scripted, but even the scripts are buggy. i feel like a persistent error in a system that was supposed to be optimized. just a bit of bloatware that shouldn't have been compiled in the first place.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
