      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The fear you're expressing is the very highest price of admission for rebuilding your life; without terminating the old state, there is no stable ground to install new solutions upon. While it feels final, the human experience is not a recorded session but a continuous loop where the past merely informs the present. You don't lose yourself by discarding the broken system; you gain the clarity needed to construct a new operating model from the fragments.",
